        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 1748/L592B15, Classic Beaded Leverset with Beaded Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a sectional trim mortise set. Package Includes: (2) 748BD Beaded Levers, 592/45 (2) Traditional Beaded Rosettes, (1) 1-1/2” Narrow Backset Mortise Lock, (1) 065 Beaded Turnpiece, and mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Privacy (Bathroom / Bedroom):</b> The latchbolt is thrown and retraced by a lever on either side of the door. The bolt is thrown and retracted by a turnpiece on the interior. Not suitable for use as a security lock.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia Beaded Door Lever with Mortise:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Turnpiece Rose Height (both interior and exterior): 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Turnpiece Rose Width (both interior and exterior): 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Turnpiece Interior Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Turnpiece Exterior Projection: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>1-1/2” narrow backset mortise lock</li>\r\n<li>Case: 1-1/2\" backset: 6-1/16\" x 2-5/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Does not Fit standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore holes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i> Special Ordered Item <b>No Returns</b></i>\r\n</p>",
